    "created_at": "2015-12-15T20:42:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-15T20:42:27Z",
    "body": "I'm very much in favour of the sentiment here, but the solution isn't to change the examples, because as foolip points out, it's much more complicated than that. The solution is to add a whole bunch more, and make them all use the female pronoun (and indeed other pronouns like \"ze\" and \"them\"). You may notice that a lot of the more recently-added examples use female pronouns (much more so than past ones).\n\nWe need to add examples anyway, so this solves multiple problems at once.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
