    "created_at": "2015-12-15T21:47:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-15T21:48:09Z",
    "body": "To reiterate: I think checking in the changes marked \"lgtm\" would be a great improvement. Additionally, we really just need to add a whole slew of new examples that are all with female characters, especially female characters in typically male-dominated fields, especially computer science and engineering since the readers are most likely to be from those fields. We need more examples anyway, so this would be easy to do while fixing existing technical problems.\n\nFor the record, I have no problem with us going way off in the other direction and generally having many more female pronouns and characters in the spec than male ones. It's not like men are suffering from under-representation in general, and especially in technical documentation. If anyone complains about this, I'm more than happy to be the contact person responsible for dealing with their complaints.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
