    "updated_at": "2015-12-16T09:07:49Z",
    "body": "A singular \"they\" in the majority of cases seems fine, but a happy mix of pronouns in examples seems fine to me, and @Hixie already lgtm'd a number of changes. I will reopen this to merge those cases, so that @tabatkins can rebase and do some they-ing on top of that.\n",
